From c8a77131d463169731ebe4ccadb254c85b332adb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gerege Systems Development Team <dev@gerege.mn>
Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 10:07:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] feat(platformd): self-updating supervisor with channels,
 window and auto-rollback

Phase 5: kernel/update implements the decision + apply state machine
(semver compare incl. prerelease, stable/beta channels, maintenance
window with overnight support, major-bump guard) and the apply flow:
apply script -> health poll -> version file on success, rollback script
on any failure. cmd/platformd is the env-configured daemon; deploy/
platformd ships update.sh / rollback.sh (git tag checkout + compose
rebuild) and a systemd unit. platformd never updates itself - the
supervisor stays outside the update path. Fully unit-tested with fake
runner/clock/manifest; smoke-tested end to end.
